ont-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6b7280; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n                                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6b7280; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Tento e-mail byl automaticky vygenerován systémem EEO v2.<br>Objednávka je nyní v realizaci.</p>\n                                    </td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </table>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <!-- Footer -->\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color: #f0fdf4; padding: 20px 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #bbf7d0;\">\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n                                &copy; 2025 EEO V2 | Elektronická Evidence Objednávek\n                            </p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n',1,'✅ Potvrzena: {order_number}','Dodavatel {supplier_name} potvrdil objednávku {order_number}','normal',1,'2025-10-29 20:46:18','2025-12-22 01:01:47'),
